<title>CHINA: China November soy products import, export totals.</title>
<headline>China November soy products import, export totals.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports and exports of soybeans, soymeal and soyoil as reported in official customs figures (percentage change is for January-November period compared with same period of previous year):</p>
<p>		 NOVEMBER IMPORTS   JAN-NOV IMPORTS    VS PVS YEAR</p>
<p> Soybeans	 166,736	     855,895	  +389.1 PERCENT</p>
<p> Soymeal	  205,240	   1,460,645     +62,145.0</p>
<p> Soyoil	    53,756	   1,106,377	    -5.9</p>
<p>(Note: all figures in tonnes)</p>
<p>		NOVEMBER EXPORTS    JAN-NOV EXPORTS    VS PREV YEAR</p>
<p> Soybeans	   5,791	    155,588	    -52.2 PERCENT</p>
<p> Soymeal	    1,549	     67,103	    -92.4</p>
<p> Soyoil		 330		3,608	    -40.6</p>
<p>(Note: all figures in tonnes)</p>
</text>
